    {
      "id": "u_9d7794fb63e3c15d81eba22d_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "In the formatting bar, go to __TRILIUM_PH_0__Insert__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__ __TRILIUM_PH_3__Columns__TRILIUM_PH_4__ to insert a layout with two columns. Its submenu offers __TRILIUM_PH_5__2 columns__TRILIUM_PH_6__, __TRILIUM_PH_7__3 columns__TRILIUM_PH_8__ and __TRILIUM_PH_9__4 columns__TRILIUM_PH_10__.",
      "sourceHash": "9d7794fb63e3c15d81eba22dbae034b2cc68c7f6763878ddeb5fa3aacc9e0a7e",
      "context": "Multicolumn layout > Inserting a layout",
      "contextHash": "592c6894d32db61271bfb9b405aaeb3a46974f2ffc629a0c536b6bb26497cb67",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "フォーマットバーで、__TRILIUM_PH_0__挿入__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__ __TRILIUM_PH_3__列__TRILIUM_PH_4__に移動し、2列のレイアウトを挿入します。サブメニューには、__TRILIUM_PH_5__2列__TRILIUM_PH_6__、__TRILIUM_PH_7__3列__TRILIUM_PH_8__、__TRILIUM_PH_9__4列__TRILIUM_PH_10__があります。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T16:50:34.717Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8762889c04d2a3ceec11d284_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Alternatively, type __TRILIUM_PH_0__ and choose __TRILIUM_PH_1__2 columns layout__TRILIUM_PH_2__, __TRILIUM_PH_3__3 columns layout__TRILIUM_PH_4__ or __TRILIUM_PH_5__4 columns layout__TRILIUM_PH_6__, as described in __TRILIUM_PH_7__Slash Commands__TRILIUM_PH_8__.",
      "sourceHash": "8762889c04d2a3ceec11d284d2c64245221fd18dd7562ea04c8a5976c0fc31a2",
      "context": "Multicolumn layout > Inserting a layout",
      "contextHash": "592c6894d32db61271bfb9b405aaeb3a46974f2ffc629a0c536b6bb26497cb67",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "または、 __TRILIUM_PH_0__ と入力して __TRILIUM_PH_1__2列レイアウト__TRILIUM_PH_2__、 __TRILIUM_PH_3__3列レイアウト__TRILIUM_PH_4__ または __TRILIUM_PH_5__4列レイアウト__TRILIUM_PH_6__を選択します（ __TRILIUM_PH_7__スラッシュコマンド__TRILIUM_PH_8__で説明されているとおりです）。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
