      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To remove the layout but keep its content, click the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ __TRILIUM_PH_1__Remove layout__TRILIUM_PH_2__ button in the layout's toolbar. The content of the columns is placed one after another where the layout was, and empty columns are left out.",
